WEBVTT

00:09:29.413 --> 00:09:32.572
trećeg jutra

00:09:32.572 --> 00:09:34.550
dok sam bila u agoniji

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:38.106
i visila sam o koncu

00:09:38.106 --> 00:09:39.569
i rekla je "Dođi ovamo"

00:09:39.569 --> 00:09:40.901
kada sam došla blizu broda rekla je:,

00:09:40.901 --> 00:09:42.536
"Pogledaj, pogledaj tamo"

00:09:42.536 --> 00:09:45.605
i vidjela sam svjetlost, 
jer danju je lakše nego noću.

00:09:45.605 --> 00:09:47.458
i mislila sam da svanjiva,

00:09:47.458 --> 00:09:50.102
i vidjela sam liniju jake svjetlosti

00:09:50.102 --> 00:09:51.481
na horizontu,

00:09:51.481 --> 00:09:53.508
i rekla sam: "Hoće li brzo svanuti?"

00:09:53.508 --> 00:09:59.450
Boni reče, "Ne, to su svjetla Key West."
(Ki Vest - grad na Floridi)

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.423
Imali smo još 15 sati plivanja,